# Fixture: a route choice into two of ours (tests/playtest.test.js): the
# engine takes the recommended option, which need not be the first. It ends
# in Brill: The Barrens across the sea, Silverpine Forest a ride south. The
# choice turns on pricing the zeppelin crossing against the ride (the play
# runs on the walking maps' client build, #3344), and on where Silverpine
# starts for an Undead: its first goal for them, not the Orgrimmar flight
# master its Orc, Troll and Tauren steps begin at.
guide handover/route-choice
title Route Choice
faction Horde
race Undead
levels 11-12
zone Tirisfal Glades
next forever/horde/02-the-barrens, forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest

step Brill
  goto 38.0,50.0 "Brill"
